{"4847210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Astro Boost", "steam_appid": 4847210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5132590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost through dangerous planets, dodge deadly obstacles, and master your momentum in this fast-paced precision platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847210/extras/3a22f7441531723244ab9b5a5051216b.poster.avif?t=1787074357\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847210/extras/3a22f7441531723244ab9b5a5051216b.webm?t=1787074357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4847210/extras/3a22f7441531723244ab9b5a5051216b.mp4?t=1787074357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your jet-powered boosts to navigate handcrafted levels filled with traps, moving hazards, and challenging platforming sequences. Every movement matters as you race toward the finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast and precise movement mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple worlds with unique hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun-friendly gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden collectibles and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players who love mastering levels, optimizing routes, and competing for the fastest times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"